===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*kʷel-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|coler}}, borrowed from {{der|en|fro|coler}} (Modern {{cog|fr|collier}}), from {{der|en|LL.|collāre}}, from {{der|en|la|collāris}}, from {{m|la|collum||neck}}. Cognate with {{cog|got|𐌷𐌰𐌻𐍃||neck}}, {{cog|ang|heals||neck}}. Compare {{cog|es|cuello||neck}}. More at {{m|en|halse}}. {{doublet|en|collet}}.

